✅ Figma Style Guide — 香港90年代（HK 90s Poster）
🎨 Color Styles

Primary Colors

HK90s/Primary/DarkBlue — #0D3B66

HK90s/Primary/NeonPink — #FF3B6B

Secondary Colors

HK90s/Secondary/NeonYellow — #FFD166

HK90s/Secondary/CyanGlow — #6BE7FF

Background

HK90s/Background/NightBlack — #0B0F1A

🔤 Text Styles

HK90s/H1 Poster

44 pt / ExtraBold / All caps

Effects → Drop Shadow (4px / 60%)

HK90s/H2

28 pt / Bold

HK90s/Body

16 pt / Regular

HK90s/Caption

12 pt / Regular

标题可加 Outer Glow（霓虹效果）：
CyanGlow 0px 0px 12px 40%

🟦 Component Tokens
Buttons

HK90s/Button/Primary

Fill: NeonPink

Radius: 8

Shadow: Hard Shadow 0 4 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.8)

Outer Glow: CyanGlow 0 0 8px

HK90s/Button/Secondary

Border: 2px NeonYellow

Fill: Transparent

Shadow: None

Cards

HK90s/Card/Poster

Fill: DarkBlue

Overlay: VHS Scanline Texture ( Soft Light 12% )

Radius: 6

📐 Layout Grid & Effects

Grid: 8 px base

Radius: 4 / 8

VHS Effects:

Horizontal Scanlines（Multiply 20%）

RGB Channel Shift（Offset 1–2px）